      <link>https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/agri-news/south-africa/steenhuisens-ministerial-future-could-hinge-on-new-da-leader/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=steenhuisens-ministerial-future-could-hinge-on-new-da-leader</link>
      <description>Minister of Agriculture John Steenhuisen has announced that he will not seek re-election as DA leader, but he will remain in his ministerial post, adding that he now intends to focus all his energy on combating the country’s devastating foot-and-mouth disease outbreak.</description>
